<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <assignments>
        <name>Append_Expert</name>
        <label>이름 누적</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>960</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>expertNames</assignToReference>
            <operator>Add</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Loop_Experts.ServiceResource.Name</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>expertNames</assignToReference>
            <operator>Add</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue> · </stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Loop_Experts</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <assignments>
        <name>Set_Skill_CDU</name>
        <label>필요 스킬 = CDU계열</label>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>480</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>requiredSkillLabel</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>CDU계열</stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Skill</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <assignments>
        <name>Set_Skill_CX</name>
        <label>필요 스킬 = CX계열</label>
        <locationX>300</locationX>
        <locationY>480</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>requiredSkillLabel</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>CX계열</stringValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Skill</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <decisions>
        <name>Decide_Skill</name>
        <label>Asset 계열 판정</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>360</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Set_Skill_CX</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>CX 계열</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Is_CDU</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Asset.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>StartsWith</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>CDU</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Set_Skill_CDU</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>CDU 계열</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Case에서 &quot;전문가 소집&quot; 버튼으로 트리거하는 Screen Flow. Case의 Asset 계열(CDU/CX)로 필요 스킬을 판정하고, 해당 스킬을 보유한 Service Resource만 조회해 화면에 표시한 뒤 Slack 채널로 소집 메시지를 발신한다. 발신은 T5_Send_Slack_Channel_Message subflow 재사용(T5-10). 표준 Swarming이 org 엔타이틀먼트로 사용 불가할 때의 대체 경로. T5-24.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>T5 Case Expert Finder Swarm {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>T5 Case Expert Finder Swarm</label>
    <loops>
        <name>Loop_Experts</name>
        <label>보유자 순회</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>840</locationY>
        <collectionReference>Get_Resource_Skills</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector>
            <targetReference>Append_Expert</targetReference>
        </nextValueConnector>
        <noMoreValuesConnector>
            <targetReference>Show_Experts</targetReference>
        </noMoreValuesConnector>
    </loops>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>Flow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Asset</name>
        <label>Asset 조회</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>240</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Decide_Skill</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Get_Case.AssetId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Asset</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Name</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Case</name>
        <label>Case 조회</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>120</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Asset</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>recordId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Case</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>CaseNumber</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Subject</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>AssetId</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Resource_Skills</name>
        <label>스킬 보유자 조회</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>720</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Loop_Experts</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>SkillId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Get_Skill.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>false</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>ServiceResourceSkill</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>ServiceResourceId</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Skill</name>
        <label>스킬 조회</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>600</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Resource_Skills</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>MasterLabel</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>requiredSkillLabel</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Skill</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>MasterLabel</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <screens>
        <name>Done_Screen</name>
        <label>소집 완료</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>1320</locationY>
        <allowBack>false</allowBack>
        <allowFinish>true</allowFinish>
        <allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <fields>
            <name>Done_Text</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;Slack 채널로 소집 메시지를 발신했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;소집 대상: &lt;b&gt;{!expertNames}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
            <styleProperties>
                <verticalAlignment>
                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
            </styleProperties>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter>
        <showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <screens>
        <name>Show_Experts</name>
        <label>매칭된 전문가 확인</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>1080</locationY>
        <allowBack>false</allowBack>
        <allowFinish>true</allowFinish>
        <allowPause>false</allowPause>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Send_Swarm_Message</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <fields>
            <name>Experts_Text</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;Case &lt;b&gt;{!Get_Case.CaseNumber}&lt;/b&gt; · 자산 &lt;b&gt;{!Get_Asset.Name}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;필요 스킬: &lt;b&gt;{!requiredSkillLabel}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;매칭된 전문가: &lt;b&gt;{!expertNames}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;확인을 누르면 Slack 채널로 소집 메시지를 발신합니다.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
            <styleProperties>
                <verticalAlignment>
                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
            </styleProperties>
        </fields>
        <showFooter>true</showFooter>
        <showHeader>true</showHeader>
    </screens>
    <start>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Case</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <subflows>
        <name>Send_Swarm_Message</name>
        <label>Slack 소집 메시지 발신</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>1200</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Done_Screen</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <flowName>T5_Send_Slack_Channel_Message</flowName>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>channelId</name>
            <value>
                <stringValue>C0BT7R84N9M</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <name>messageText</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Swarm_Message</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
    </subflows>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>Swarm_Message</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>:rotating_light: [전문가 소집] Case {!Get_Case.CaseNumber}
{!Get_Case.Subject}

대상 자산: {!Get_Asset.Name}
필요 스킬: {!requiredSkillLabel}
소집 대상: {!expertNames}

해당 스킬 보유자만 선별해 소집했습니다. Case 채널에서 협업해 주세요.</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <variables>
        <name>expertNames</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
    <variables>
        <name>recordId</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>true</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
    <variables>
        <name>requiredSkillLabel</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <isCollection>false</isCollection>
        <isInput>false</isInput>
        <isOutput>false</isOutput>
    </variables>
</Flow>
